title: 'statement-store: drop explicit-affine statements once affinity lapses'

doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    Statements persisted only for explicit topic affinity are now dropped during store
    maintenance once no affinity covers them, typically after the last matching RPC
    subscription ends. The removal skips the re-acceptance ban, so peers may redeliver a
    dropped statement should affinity return. Configured-topic and DHT-affine statements
    are unaffected.

crates:
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: minor
